---
{
  title: "valid_path"
}
---
### NAME

    valid_path()

### SYNOPSIS

    string valid_path( string base_dir, string path );

### PARAMETERS

    base_dir  (string)
              The base directory to resolve relative paths from.

    path      (string)
              The path to resolve and validate.

### RETURN VALUES

    (string|int) The resolved absolute path if valid, or 0 if invalid.
